  "details": "I have a habit of browsing new worlds on the website while stuck at school work, and pretty often I'll come across new worlds that are against TOS (usually stuff like \"18+ ERP horny sex dungeon\" with a cropped-porn thumbnail). And as much as I also hate it, I do want to remind people that a lot of children play this game and they really shouldn't be seeing that. \n\nI'd like to be able to report worlds from the website but I can only do that from in-game. It'd be nice if this could be changed cause I hate seeing worlds like that, VRC players can be just obnoxiously horny I swear.\n\n(For those who make/enjoy those worlds: Please just make them private and share the world URL around instead of publicly listing it. I don't care what you do, I just don't want to see it.)",
